    <h3>Tekst do zapamiętania</h3>
    <p class="en" style="display:block; padding:14px 18px; line-height:1.9;">
      Moving out of your parents' house is one of the biggest steps towards independence. When I moved into my first flat, I had no idea how many chores were involved in running a household. I had to learn how to do the washing, cook proper meals and, above all, stick to a budget. My flatmate and I share the housework equally – we take turns cleaning, doing the dishes and taking out the rubbish. Living alone teaches you to be responsible and self-reliant. Of course, there are downsides – it can get lonely, and the bills never stop coming. Still, I wouldn't trade this experience for anything.
    </p>

    <h3>Dom i obowiązki – słownictwo B2</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Angielski</th><th>Polski</th></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">chore</td><td class="pl">obowiązek domowy</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">housework</td><td class="pl">prace domowe</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">household</td><td class="pl">gospodarstwo domowe</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">household chores</td><td class="pl">obowiązki domowe</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">flatmate / roommate</td><td class="pl">współlokator</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">landlord / tenant</td><td class="pl">właściciel / najemca</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">rent / bills</td><td class="pl">czynsz / rachunki</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">mortgage</td><td class="pl">kredyt hipoteczny</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">to move in / out</td><td class="pl">wprowadzić się / wyprowadzić</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">to run a household</td><td class="pl">prowadzić dom</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Obowiązki domowe – czynności</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">do the washing / laundry</td><td class="pl">prać</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">do the washing-up / do the dishes</td><td class="pl">zmywać</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">do the ironing</td><td class="pl">prasować</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">do the hoovering / vacuuming</td><td class="pl">odkurzać</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">mop the floor</td><td class="pl">myć podłogę</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">make the bed</td><td class="pl">ścielić łóżko</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">take out the rubbish / bins</td><td class="pl">wynosić śmieci</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">tidy up</td><td class="pl">sprzątnąć</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">dust the furniture</td><td class="pl">odkurzać meble</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">walk the dog</td><td class="pl">wyprowadzać psa</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Dzielenie obowiązków</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">share the housework</td><td class="pl">dzielić prace domowe</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">take turns doing sth</td><td class="pl">robić coś na zmianę</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">split the bills</td><td class="pl">dzielić rachunki</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">pull one's weight</td><td class="pl">przykładać się do pracy</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">do one's fair share</td><td class="pl">robić swoje</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">take responsibility for sth</td><td class="pl">brać odpowiedzialność za</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">stick to a budget</td><td class="pl">trzymać się budżetu</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">make ends meet</td><td class="pl">wiązać koniec z końcem</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Mieszkanie – przymiotniki B2</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">spacious</td><td class="pl">przestronny</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">cosy</td><td class="pl">przytulny</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">cluttered</td><td class="pl">zagracony</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">run-down</td><td class="pl">w złym stanie, zaniedbany</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">well-kept</td><td class="pl">zadbany</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">furnished / unfurnished</td><td class="pl">umeblowany / nieumeblowany</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">fully equipped</td><td class="pl">w pełni wyposażony</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">self-contained</td><td class="pl">samodzielny (z własnym wejściem)</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Zwroty o domu i obowiązkach</h3>
    <table>
