    <h3>Tekst do zapamiętania</h3>
    <p class="en" style="display:block; padding:14px 18px; line-height:1.9;">
      I've always been passionate about photography. I took it up about five years ago, and since then it has become much more than just a hobby – it's a way of seeing the world. What I love most about it is the way it forces you to slow down and notice details you would otherwise miss. On top of that, it's a great way to unwind after a long week. Some of my friends are into extreme sports; others are keen on cooking or gardening. In my view, the best hobby is the one that genuinely helps you switch off from everyday stress. Whether it's reading, running or playing an instrument, having a passion makes life richer.
    </p>

