window.LESSON_DATA["T8B2"] = {
  tytul: "Natura i środowisko – poziom zaawansowany",
  poziom: "B2",
  dzial: "T8",
  teoria: `
    <h3>Tekst do zapamiętania</h3>
    <p class="en" style="display:block; padding:14px 18px; line-height:1.9;">
      Climate change is arguably the greatest challenge facing our generation. Scientists warn that unless we take drastic action soon, the consequences will be irreversible. Rising temperatures are already having a devastating effect on ecosystems – glaciers are melting, sea levels are rising and extreme weather events are becoming more frequent. Some argue that individual actions, such as recycling or cycling to work, are pointless when big corporations keep polluting on a massive scale. I agree to some extent, but I also believe that collective pressure from ordinary citizens can force companies and governments to change. The transition to renewable energy is not only necessary but also, in the long run, economically beneficial.
    </p>

    <h3>Środowisko – słownictwo B2</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Angielski</th><th>Polski</th></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">climate change</td><td class="pl">zmiana klimatu</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">global warming</td><td class="pl">globalne ocieplenie</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">greenhouse gases</td><td class="pl">gazy cieplarniane</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">carbon footprint</td><td class="pl">ślad węglowy</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">renewable energy</td><td class="pl">energia odnawialna</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">fossil fuels</td><td class="pl">paliwa kopalne</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">deforestation</td><td class="pl">wycinanie lasów</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">pollution</td><td class="pl">zanieczyszczenie</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">sustainability</td><td class="pl">zrównoważony rozwój</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">endangered species</td><td class="pl">gatunki zagrożone wyginięciem</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">natural disaster</td><td class="pl">klęska żywiołowa</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">sea level</td><td class="pl">poziom morza</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Działania proekologiczne</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">reduce one's carbon footprint</td><td class="pl">zmniejszyć ślad węglowy</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">conserve energy</td><td class="pl">oszczędzać energię</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">cut down on plastic</td><td class="pl">ograniczyć plastik</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">use public transport</td><td class="pl">korzystać z transportu publicznego</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">plant trees</td><td class="pl">sadzić drzewa</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">protect wildlife</td><td class="pl">chronić dziką przyrodę</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">preserve natural habitats</td><td class="pl">zachować naturalne siedliska</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">raise awareness</td><td class="pl">podnosić świadomość</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">take action</td><td class="pl">podjąć działania</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">go green</td><td class="pl">postawić na ekologię</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Wyrażanie opinii o ekologii</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">Scientists warn that...</td><td class="pl">Naukowcy ostrzegają, że...</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">Unless we..., the consequences will be...</td><td class="pl">Jeśli nie..., konsekwencje będą...</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">It is widely believed that...</td><td class="pl">Powszechnie uważa się, że...</td></tr>
