window.LESSON_DATA["T9B2"] = {
  tytul: "Technologia – życie cyfrowe i jego skutki",
  poziom: "B2",
  dzial: "T9",
  teoria: `
    <h3>Tekst do zapamiętania</h3>
    <p class="en" style="display:block; padding:14px 18px; line-height:1.9;">
      Technology has transformed almost every aspect of our lives, from the way we work to the way we socialise. On the one hand, digital tools allow us to stay connected with people on the other side of the world, access unlimited information and manage our lives more efficiently. On the other hand, there is growing evidence that excessive screen time has a negative impact on our mental health and concentration. Studies show that constant notifications and social media algorithms are designed to keep us hooked. I try to keep a healthy balance – I use apps to organise my day and stay in touch with friends, but I also have strict rules about when I switch off. In my view, technology should serve us, not the other way round.
    </p>

    <h3>Technologia – słownictwo B2</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Angielski</th><th>Polski</th></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">digital tools</td><td class="pl">narzędzia cyfrowe</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">screen time</td><td class="pl">czas przed ekranem</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">notifications</td><td class="pl">powiadomienia</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">algorithm</td><td class="pl">algorytm</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">to be hooked on sth</td><td class="pl">być uzależnionym od</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">digital detox</td><td class="pl">cyfrowy detoks</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">privacy settings</td><td class="pl">ustawienia prywatności</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">cyberbullying</td><td class="pl">przemoc w internecie</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">data breach</td><td class="pl">wyciek danych</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">encryption</td><td class="pl">szyfrowanie</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">digital literacy</td><td class="pl">kompetencje cyfrowe</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">automation</td><td class="pl">automatyzacja</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Czynności online – pogłębione</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">stay connected</td><td class="pl">pozostawać w kontakcie</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">access information</td><td class="pl">mieć dostęp do informacji</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">browse / scroll</td><td class="pl">przeglądać / przewijać</td></tr>
