  teoria: `
    <h3>Tekst do zapamiętania</h3>
    <p class="en" style="display:block; padding:14px 18px; line-height:1.9;">
      It's difficult to predict exactly what the world will look like in twenty years. However, some changes already seem inevitable. Artificial intelligence is likely to play an increasingly important role in our daily lives – from healthcare and education to transport and entertainment. Some experts predict that many jobs will disappear or change beyond recognition, while others argue that new professions will emerge. Either way, the key challenge will be adapting to change. On the one hand, AI could help us solve some of the biggest problems facing humanity, such as climate change and disease. On the other hand, it raises serious ethical questions about privacy, autonomy and control. In my view, we should embrace the opportunities while staying alert to the risks.
    </p>

    <h3>Przyszłość – słownictwo B2</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Angielski</th><th>Polski</th></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">inevitable</td><td class="pl">nieunikniony</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">predict / prediction</td><td class="pl">przewidywać / przewidywanie</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">forecast</td><td class="pl">prognoza</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">emerging technology</td><td class="pl">nowa technologia</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">breakthrough</td><td class="pl">przełom</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">innovation</td><td class="pl">innowacja</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">artificial intelligence (AI)</td><td class="pl">sztuczna inteligencja</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">automation</td><td class="pl">automatyzacja</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">machine learning</td><td class="pl">uczenie maszynowe</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">algorithm</td><td class="pl">algorytm</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">disruptive technology</td><td class="pl">technologia przełomowa</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">transhumanism</td><td class="pl">transhumanizm</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Wpływ AI – pozytywne i negatywne</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">revolutionise an industry</td><td class="pl">zrewolucjonizować branżę</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">boost productivity</td><td class="pl">zwiększyć produktywność</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">enhance human capabilities</td><td class="pl">wzmocnić możliwości człowieka</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">automate tasks</td><td class="pl">zautomatyzować zadania</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">replace workers</td><td class="pl">zastąpić pracowników</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">pose a threat to jobs</td><td class="pl">stanowić zagrożenie dla miejsc pracy</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">widen the gap between rich and poor</td><td class="pl">powiększać przepaść między bogatymi a biednymi</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">raise ethical concerns</td><td class="pl">rodzić wątpliwości etyczne</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">have unintended consequences</td><td class="pl">mieć niezamierzone konsekwencje</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">fall behind the curve</td><td class="pl">zostać w tyle</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Etyka i społeczeństwo</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">privacy</td><td class="pl">prywatność</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">autonomy</td><td class="pl">autonomia</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">accountability</td><td class="pl">odpowiedzialność</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">bias in algorithms</td><td class="pl">stronniczość algorytmów</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">surveillance</td><td class="pl">nadzór, inwigilacja</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">data protection</td><td class="pl">ochrona danych</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">digital divide</td><td class="pl">podział cyfrowy</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">job displacement</td><td class="pl">utrata miejsc pracy (z powodu technologii)</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Wyrażanie opinii o przyszłości</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">It is likely / unlikely that...</td><td class="pl">Prawdopodobnie / raczej nie...</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">There is a strong possibility that...</td><td class="pl">Istnieje duże prawdopodobieństwo, że...</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">The question is whether...</td><td class="pl">Pytanie brzmi, czy...</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">I have no doubt that...</td><td class="pl">Nie mam wątpliwości, że...</td></tr>
