    </table>

    <h3>Zwroty z "likely" i "unlikely"</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="en">be likely to + V</td><td class="en">AI is likely to transform healthcare.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="en">be unlikely to + V</td><td class="en">The technology is unlikely to replace teachers completely.</td></tr>
